{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream On</strong> is a short first-person walking simulator focused on introspection and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll embark on a meditative journey through a symbolic dreamscape, exploring surreal environments that reflect the inner world of fears, hopes, and desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659920/extras/9abad270b3e378c143de373b0fa942e5.poster.avif?t=1772700642\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659920/extras/9abad270b3e378c143de373b0fa942e5.webm?t=1772700642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659920/extras/9abad270b3e378c143de373b0fa942e5.mp4?t=1772700642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A brief experience \u2014 the game can be completed in about 5-10 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Linear narrative with symbolic visuals and ambient storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive sound design \u2014 no dialogue or text, just music and sound to guide your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple controls \u2014 walk, look around, and interact with key objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A meaningful choice at the end \u2014 what will you wish for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659920/extras/f6cb42a4a0cd643a378a8bf4c9eb2c7e.poster.avif?t=1772700642\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659920/extras/f6cb42a4a0cd643a378a8bf4c9eb2c7e.webm?t=1772700642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659920/extras/f6cb42a4a0cd643a378a8bf4c9eb2c7e.mp4?t=1772700642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream On is not about challenges or puzzles. It's a quiet space to reflect, feel, and simply <i>be</i>. Perfect for players looking for a short emotional escape or a peaceful moment before sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659920/extras/a98f2453e7a109c2aa3217062f0b0322.poster.avif?t=1772700642\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659920/extras/a98f2453e7a109c2aa3217062f0b0322.webm?t=1772700642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659920/extras/a98f2453e7a109c2aa3217062f0b0322.mp4?t=1772700642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"There are no more fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3659920/9954aa448119428274f3a2949c791a78d9422d8b.jpg"},{"name":"Unfulfilled wishes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3659920/9c5c3418dbed5d83fd6228027152ae637cbfda34.jpg"},{"name":"Dream On","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3659920/a9949c8236b740068ad11e3178a362c092678f06.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659920?t=1772700642","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/36